DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       These functions return the (real) cube root of _x.  This function cannot
       fail; every representable real value has a real cube root, and rounding
       it to a representable value never causes overflow nor underflow.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEE
       These functions return the cube root of _x.

       If  _x is +0, -0, positive infinity, negative infinity, or NaN, _x is re‐
       turned.

